ofile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20060813161320&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Soul_Stone_3e756b.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a soul stone.<div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 0.30 oz.</div><div class=\"p-flavortext\">It contains the essence of countless tormented souls.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"><span class=\"tibiatext tibiaorange\"><ul class=\"sound-list\"></ul></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>It was once hard to obtain, because it was only lootable from <a href=\"#/wiki/Necropharus\">Necropharus</a> which was only a rare spawn, supported by many Necromancers. The price dropped due to a quest and multiple spawning places. Finally, the price collapsed after it become lootable from bosses with daily repeatable fights.\n<br/>\n</p><p>Needed for an addon of <a href=\"#/wiki/Mage%20Outfits\">Mage Outfits</a> (male) / <a href=\"#/wiki/Summoner%20Outfits\">Summoner Outfits</a> (female).\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Alptramun\">Alptramun</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Izcandar%20Champion%20of%20Summer\">Izcandar Champion of Summer</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Izcandar%20the%20Banished\">Izcandar the Banished</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Malofur%20Mangrinder\">Malofur Mangrinder</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Maxxenius\">Maxxenius</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Necropharus\">Necropharus</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Plagueroot\">Plagueroot</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/The%20Blazing%20Time%20Guardian\">The Blazing Time Guardian</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/